// 1. Abandon tracking distributed copies; enforce an authoritative consent ledger at egress
def sync_to_destination(record, destination, ledger):
    # The standard idea of passing tokens downstream fails because adtech APIs strip them.
    # Instead, treat all destinations as untrusted and fail closed at the boundary.
    grant = ledger.get_active_grant(record.id, destination.purpose)
    if not grant:
        return dispatch_tombstone(destination, record.egress_id)

    # 2. Use rotating, time-bound pseudonyms rather than persistent hashed emails
    egress_payload = project_with_epoch_id(record, epoch=grant.epoch)
    audit_receipt = ledger.sign_egress(destination.id, egress_payload.id, grant.id)
    destination.push(egress_payload, proof=audit_receipt)

// 3. Address ML models by bounding model lifespan rather than pretending unlearning works
def train_activation_model(training_store):
    # Machine unlearning in production lookalikes is fantasy; the honest fix is disposable models.
    dataset = training_store.snapshot_active_only(as_of=now())
    model = retrain_from_scratch(dataset)
    schedule_hard_deletion(model, ttl_days=30)  # Deletion is proved by artifact destruction

// 4. Handle GPC and external walled gardens (Meta, Google, co-ops)
def process_opt_out(identity_signal, ledger):
    # GPC gives device context, not identity; do not guess CRM links without deterministic login.
    ledger.tombstone_device(identity_signal.device_id)
    # Honest limit: you cannot verify platform-side deletion, only prove timely dispatch of API calls.
    return [api.delete(dest, identity_signal) for dest in registered_destinations]

Stop shipping copies—
let each hop ask, and log asks;
retrain on a clock.

Sleep softly, map each copied trail through warehouse, tool, and queue;
Send canary opt-outs after it, then see which claims are true.

A token isn't proof, dear stack, though standards help it roam;
Require receipts and reconcile each audience brought home.

For features, bind each training run to lineage, scope, and time;
Retrain or sunset when required—unlearning's not yet prime.

Begin with one activation path, then widen what we know;
Beyond our walls, contracts and tests—not proof—the gaps still show.
